+-------------------------------------------------------
+<a name="onIdle"></a>
+### queue.onIdle() => Promise
+
+Returns a promise that resolves when the queue has no tasks being processed and
+no tasks waiting to be processed. Each call creates an independent promise. An
+already idle queue returns a resolved promise. A paused queue with pending tasks
+is not idle.
+
+The promise resolves after `drain` has run and any synchronous work it enqueues
+has been accounted for. Calling `onIdle()` does not change the user-defined
+`drain` function.
+
 -------------------------------------------------------
